<title>INDIA: Court charges India's Rao in cheating case - PTI.</title>
<headline>Court charges India's Rao in cheating case - PTI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Delhi court on Wednesday laid formal charges against former Indian prime minister P.V. Narasimha Rao over a 1983 cheating case, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
<p>PTI said trial court judge Ajit Bharihoke said his court was also charging a Hindu guru and his assistant in the case.</p>
</text>
